            'This audit freshly inspects the historical/current contracts and scope/seed reviews. It checks cited-file availability and hashes, not every source calculation or the mathematical sufficiency of each proof. The checker enforces accounting and refuses several scope promotions; it cannot certify that no unlisted scientific hole exists.','',
